    <p>
      Resulting in this map when rendered in a browser (slightly cropped, with the trail name as the title of the tab):
    </p>

    <figure xml:id="fig-7-25-black-heritage-trail">
      <caption>Tourism map of Boston with a thick yellow line marking the Black Heritage Trail.</caption>
