            A slightly cropped browser view displaying the heading "Black Heritage Trail" at the top above the Boston National Historical Park map. Along Beacon Hill, a thick yellow-amber polyline traces the full route of the Black Heritage Trail from the Robert Gould Shaw Memorial through the north slope of Beacon Hill to the African Meeting House.
          </p>
